; ■ 悪魔との契約 - 第3話：同好会結成
*start

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_1
; Scene 1: 翌日／隠せない
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="science_prep_room.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_tension.mp3"]

The next day.[l][er]
—The seven of them and I gathered again in the same science prep room as yesterday.[l][er]

—For the same reason.[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#seitokai
Let us continue where we left off yesterday.[l][er]

#seitokai
Our bodies will not go back.[l][er]

#seitokai
That is settled.[l][er]

#seitokai
However, how we live from here has not yet been decided.[l][er]

#seitokai
So—the practical problems, starting tomorrow.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]
[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="sad" pos="center" time="500"]

#osananajimi
Are we really just going to come to school every day like this?[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="default" pos="right" time="500"]

#gyaru
We kinda have to.[l][er]

#gyaru
If we skip, the rumors'll get even worse.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
Assuming we attend—[l][er]

#seitokai
we need a "reason."[l][er]

#protagonist
A reason.[l][er]

#seitokai
Why we suddenly gained muscle.[l][er]

#seitokai
"A devil's potion" cannot be used as an explanation.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]
[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
"We started working out"—but it's too sudden.[l][er]

#otaku
"Illness"—but there's no medical certificate.[l][er]

#otaku
"An accident"—but there are no scars.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]

—We're stuck, I thought.[l][er]

#protagonist
...I'll go too.[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
Go where?[l][er]

#protagonist
In front of the teachers. In front of everyone.[l][er]

#protagonist
If someone has to explain, I'll be the one who steps forward.[l][er]

#protagonist
Even if I can't tell them everything about the devil, I won't hide that I'm involved.[l][er]

The seven of them fell silent.[l][er]

#osananajimi
...You're late.[l][er]

#protagonist
I know.[l][er]

#osananajimi
But it's better than never saying it.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]


; ================================================================================
*start_scene_2
; Scene 2: ギャルの提案／看板
; ================================================================================

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#gyaru
Hey.[l][er]

#gyaru
Everyone's been talking about "how to hide it" this whole time, but—[l][er]

#protagonist
What else is there?[l][er]

#gyaru
The opposite.[l][er]

#protagonist
...The opposite?[l][er]

#gyaru
We put up a sign.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
A sign, meaning?[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]
[chara_show name="gyaru" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#gyaru
Like, "we got like this because we've been doing something."[l][er]

#gyaru
We say it first, before anyone asks.[l][er]

#gyaru
If we put up a sign saying "this is what happens when you train," then—[l][er]

#gyaru
nobody digs any deeper.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
...The logic holds.[l][er]

#otaku
We prepare the answer to "why" ourselves.[l][er]

#otaku
A preemptive strike.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]
[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#kakutogi
"Doing something"—like what?[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="smile" pos="right" time="500"]

#gyaru
A club.[l][er]

#gyaru
A weightlifting kind of club.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
A "Muscle Club"—is that it?[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="smile" pos="right" time="500"]

#gyaru
Yep.[l][er]

#gyaru
You know, I figured something out yesterday.[l][er]

#gyaru
I'm done being "buried."[l][er]

#gyaru
So if we're doing this, we put the sign up loud and proud.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]

—Her idea[l][er]
wasn't "running away." It was "admitting it first."[l][er]

No one had a better plan.[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#osananajimi
...Is that really okay?[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="smile" pos="right" time="500"]

#kakutogi
I'm in.[l][er]

#kakutogi
If we're training, we train out in the open.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="500"]
[chara_show name="furyo" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#furyo
...If outsiders can join,[l][er]

#furyo
I'm fine with it too.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="furyo" time="500"]
[chara_show name="imouto" face="blush" pos="center" time="500"]

#imouto
...As for me...[l][er]

#imouto
I want to stand on the side where I'm not "the little sister."[l][er]

[chara_hide name="imouto" time="500"]
[chara_show name="otaku" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
It would also be an ideal environment for data collection.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]
[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
...It is decided.[l][er]

#seitokai
We will establish the "Muscle Club."[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]


