*start_scene_3
; Scene 3: 設立
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="student_council_room.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_daily.mp3"]

The student council room.[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#seitokai
Purpose of establishment: "The healthy development of body and mind."[l][er]

#seitokai
Advisor: Mr. Tanaka, physical education.[l][er]

#seitokai
Members: six.[l][er]

#seitokai
Outside collaborators: one.[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="default" pos="left" time="500"]

#gyaru
Are we seriously going with "Muscle Club" as the name?[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="right" time="500"]

#seitokai
The point is to put up a sign.[l][er]

#seitokai
The clearer the name, the better.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
...With this, it is officially established.[l][er]

—The thump of a stamp.[l][er]

For some reason, the sound was light.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="500"]


