*start_scene_4
; Scene 4: 初日の活動／規格外
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="gym.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_fight.mp3"]

After school. The gym.[l][er]
—The seven of them, and me.[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#kakutogi
Let's check the basics.[l][er]

#kakutogi
Someone hold the sandbag.[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="default" pos="left" time="500"]

#osananajimi
I'll do it.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="500"]

—Hibiki threw one light punch.[l][er]

The sandbag swayed.[l][er]
—No, not just the sandbag.[l][er]
Yui, holding it, swayed right along with it.[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#osananajimi
...Oof, heavy.[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="surprised" pos="right" time="500"]

#kakutogi
I thought I was holding back.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]
[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="500"]

—That was her holding back.[l][er]

[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
I brought a grip dynamometer.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]

—We took turns squeezing it.[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#gyaru
No way, I maxed it out.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="500"]
[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
"Maxing it out" means—[l][er]

#otaku
we are beyond what the instrument was designed to measure.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]

Silence.[l][er]

—What we had become[l][er]
wasn't shown by a number.[l][er]
It was shown by the fact that we couldn't be measured.[l][er]

[chara_show name="imouto" face="sad" pos="center" time="500"]

#imouto
...Hey.[l][er]

#imouto
If my brother saw me now...[l][er]

#imouto
would he still think of me as his "little sister"?[l][er]

[chara_hide name="imouto" time="500"]

—Nobody answered.[l][er]


; ================================================================================
*start_scene_5
; Scene 5: 主人公／共犯
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="gym.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_sadness.mp3"]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#osananajimi
You too.[l][er]

#protagonist
Huh?[l][er]

#osananajimi
Give it a try.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="500"]

—I squeezed the dynamometer.[l][er]

—Thirty-eight kilograms.[l][er]

[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
That's the average for a second-year high school boy.[l][er]

#otaku
You haven't changed at all.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="otaku" time="500"]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#protagonist
(The seven of them are standing here in bodies they can never take back.)[l][er]

#protagonist
(—And yet,)[l][er]

#protagonist
(I'm the one who caused it, and I'm the only one who hasn't changed one bit.)[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#kakutogi
You're a club member too.[l][er]

#protagonist
Huh?[l][er]

#kakutogi
Not just "someone involved."[l][er]

#kakutogi
You're one of us, in the same boat.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="500"]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

—There was nowhere left to run.[l][er]

Not "the culprit,"[l][er]
not "a bystander,"[l][er]
—an accomplice.[l][er]


; ================================================================================
*start_scene_6
; Scene 6: 一週間後／悪魔の問い
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="rooftop_night.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_devil.mp3"]

—A week passed.[l][er]

The seven of them gathered in the gym every day as club members.[l][er]
It wasn't that they'd "gotten used to it."[l][er]
They were just pretending they had.[l][er]

I was on the roof.[l][er]

The wind was strong.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#akuma
Time for me to come ask.[l][er]

#protagonist
...You.[l][er]

#akuma
There are seven of them, after all.[l][er]

#akuma
Time to decide.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Decide what?[l][er]

#akuma
Who you're going to face.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
"Kinda with everyone"—doesn't count.[l][er]

#akuma
You pick one.[l][er]

#akuma
"Choosing no one" is also an option.[l][er]

#protagonist
What I'm deciding[l][er]

#protagonist
isn't who to make my girlfriend.[l][er]

#akuma
Oh?[l][er]

#protagonist
So that I don't run away from any of them—[l][er]

#protagonist
I'm deciding who to talk to first.[l][er]

#akuma
Nice. But remember this.[l][er]

#akuma
While you're being nice to everyone—someone might reach for the second bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
And if you spend your time on one, you'll be taking your eyes off the other six.[l][er]

#akuma
Either way, I won't go hungry.[l][er]

#protagonist
...[l][er]

#akuma
Go on.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]

—The choices appeared before me.[l][er]

